--- !u!114 &517802235875886569
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7948564445248165891}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7fc7e4668d5e66446b840e1825c1ee0d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isRequest: 0
  emailName: Manager
  header: Our Expectations of YOU!
  requestMessage: "Hey there, Champ!\n\nA little birdie told me the boss has given
    you an amazing opportunity to join our most profitable business venture: information
    verification. I know this may seem sudden, and it is absolutely not in your job
    description or qualifications. But look at it positively this is a fantastic
    chance for you to boost your performance rating, prove your worth, and maybe
    even rediscover what sleep feels like. And don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll be here
    every step of the way to help you out. \n\nWell, at least I would be, if I didn\u2019t
    have a very important meeting coming up this afternoon that absolutely cannot
    be rescheduled. Still, I can give you a quick show of how it all works, and I\u2019m
    sure you\u2019ll do fine after all, pressure is just opportunity wearing a tighter
    deadline. So, just to check that you\u2019re up to speed with the latest trends
    and terminology,\nmake sure you remember these three vital points:\n\n1. True
    Information -- accurate, verified, and factual data backed by verifiable evidence
    and reliable sources\n\n2. Misinformation -- false or inaccurate information
    shared unintentionally, without intent to cause harm or deceive.\n\n3. Disinformation
    -- false or misleading information that is deliberately created and spread to
    deceive people or cause harm.\n\nYou\u2019re completely trustworthy, superior,\nSir.
    Manager"
  nameText: {fileID: 4385182146089471647}
  requestTitle: {fileID: 4498540935327707425}
